*.tsbuildinfo

# Generated by Next.js on every `dev` and every `build`, and written *differently* by each: `dev`
# points it at `.next/dev/types/`, `build` at `.next/types/`. Tracking it meant running the
# dashboard dirtied the working tree in a file whose own header says not to edit it (`T-187`).
# Safe to ignore: `npm run typecheck` was measured passing with the file absent **and** with no
# generated type directories at all — the CI condition, since CI typechecks before it builds.
frontend/next-env.d.ts

# Build output
dist/
build/
